            },
            {
                "entry_id": "c5c8e7e8-b4e1-3a4b-a781-9beb5f579cce",
                "word": "cloop",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "2b41dc57-68a5-4d7e-a0a6-eb57e26ad0f1",
                        "entry_id": "c5c8e7e8-b4e1-3a4b-a781-9beb5f579cce",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "cloops"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2272790d-4914-30d4-965e-069016ff92bd",
                        "entry_id": "c5c8e7e8-b4e1-3a4b-a781-9beb5f579cce",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A small, seedy bar or nightclub; a dive."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b6485f8-8dd8-42bf-b80e-2b1852c5d0a6",
                                "sense_id": "2272790d-4914-30d4-965e-069016ff92bd",
                                "text": "He had resolved not to segue into the jig he used to do in the \"cloops\" because his singing was the issue here."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "841f32ed-a4ba-4560-b856-ec65af743402",
                                "sense_id": "2272790d-4914-30d4-965e-069016ff92bd",
                                "text": "This may be a deliberate tie-in to what Gene [Kelly]'s brother Fred [Norbert Kelly] did when they played the \"cloops\" as teenagers."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c1b55834-69bb-4468-9680-6ceedfe0de2b",
                                "sense_id": "2272790d-4914-30d4-965e-069016ff92bd",
                                "text": "Kelly wasn't a singer, but a talented dancer who had also spent many hours in vaudeville houses and after-hours \"cloops,\" learning tap steps from the great vaudevillians and street dancers in order to bring these steps back to his students at the Kelly family dance studio."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "d949a70b-8cf9-3a6c-969c-ea4ccbb1eeae",
                "word": "cloop",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "78ec4db8-f4b3-3101-b8f5-f8f4f164c4cd",
                        "entry_id": "d949a70b-8cf9-3a6c-969c-ea4ccbb1eeae",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A compression technology for Linux files stored on a read-only block device that allows files to be decompressed on the fly."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "df2c1e4f-d486-409e-80aa-875a1df816de",
                                "sense_id": "78ec4db8-f4b3-3101-b8f5-f8f4f164c4cd",
                                "text": "The magic is in the big file called /KNOPPIX/KNOPPIX, an ISO9660 filesystem image compressed for the cloop device."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d4cac5b-401c-4d69-9f05-c141446eda38",
                                "sense_id": "78ec4db8-f4b3-3101-b8f5-f8f4f164c4cd",
                                "text": "Using cloop technology, you can more than double the amount of software and data you can get on a live CD."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9fc8004c-3a33-474e-bb7d-0d5d36f10e29",
                                "sense_id": "78ec4db8-f4b3-3101-b8f5-f8f4f164c4cd",
                                "text": "Load a MyDSL extension (xchat.uci) to check that the cloop driver is working."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "595632e9-7a44-36f8-b03f-4799f3c96983",
